+/**
+ * @brief Reports whether the sidecar knows a clip's proxy to be stale.
+ *
+ * The proxy is stale when the source's content differs from the content the
+ * proxy was made from. A source whose content changed is observed in the
+ * sidecar first. Unknown clips, unrecorded proxies, and every failure yield
+ * false, so Kdenlive keeps its proxy as before.
+ */
+bool isProxyStale(const QString &projectPath, const QString &controlUuid, const QString &sourcePath, const QString &proxyPath);
